# Keep the docker build context lean. Everything the image needs stays: the app
# under src/, configs/, requirements/, the sealed snapshot folder and its
# registry, the dataset cleaned_recipes.json, and the staged model weights
# under .docker/weights/. Everything else in the tree is build/working state
# that would otherwise be shipped to the builder on every image build.
#
# The snapshot folder name is baked by ARG SNAPSHOT at build time, so the
# sealed folders cannot be excluded piecemeal here; any sealed snapshot (a few
# hundred MB over the tree) rides in with the one the build actually copies.

# Version control and agent/editor state
.git
.gitignore
.github
.lavish
.agents
.claude
CLAUDE.md

# Python working files
.venv
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.eggs

# Local data, model repos, and experiment state not copied into the image
data/raw
data/eval
models
mlruns
mlflow.db
mlartifacts
.tmp

# DVC internals and pointer files
.dvc
*.dvc

# Dev tooling and docs not needed at runtime
scripts
tests
docs

# Scratch and logs
temp
*.log
